WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.137
Step 1. Open the list for the type of record. Categories group activity definitions,

1.2
00:00:06.137 --> 00:00:10.201
charge item definitions or Product Knowledge like folders.

1.3
00:00:10.201 --> 00:00:14.275
In Settings, open the list for your type of record.

2.1
00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:17.751
Step 2. Go to the level of the new category.

2.2
00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:21.417
Stay at the top level to add a top-level category,

2.3
00:00:21.417 --> 00:00:25.509
or open the parent category to add a subcategory.

3.1
00:00:25.509 --> 00:00:30.946
Step 3. Add the category. Select Add Category, then enter the Name.

3.2
00:00:30.946 --> 00:00:36.442
Care fills in the Slug, and sets Resource Sub Type to Other by default.

3.3
00:00:36.442 --> 00:00:38.722
Select Create Category.

4.1
00:00:38.722 --> 00:00:40.787
Step 4. Edit a category.

4.2
00:00:40.787 --> 00:00:45.928
On the card of the category, select the menu button with three dots.

4.3
00:00:45.928 --> 00:00:54.442
Change the name, slug, description or sub type, then select Update Category.
